!!! 09-memory.matrix
!!! Owned buffers, lexical borrowing, moves, raw pointers and references.
!!!
!!! Ownership operations are statements, not initialiser expressions, because
!!! Ny requires every ownership operation to be a direct local declaration
!!! initialiser. Expressing that in the grammar means the restriction is a
!!! parse rule rather than a later semantic error.
!!!
!!! Owners and views cannot be parameters, results, globals, record fields,
!!! array elements or captures. Read a scalar out to pass it elsewhere.

book tour.memory

Reading begin record
    field level as number
end record

!!! A reference parameter shares object identity with the caller. Field
!!! mutation is visible through aliases; rebinding the parameter is not.
!!! Scalar reference creation is rejected.
bump receives sample as reference to Reading returns nothing begin paragraph
    set sample.level to sample.level plus 1
end paragraph

main returns number begin paragraph

    !!! An owned buffer is zero-initialised. A count below one requests one
    !!! element; an oversized allocation fails. Mutating it requires a
    !!! mutable owner.
    own variable samples as array of number sized 64
    set samples at 0 to 42

    !!! Shared views. Several may coexist and the owner may still be read, but
    !!! writes and moves are forbidden until every view's lexical scope ends.
    !!! Lifetimes are lexical, not last-use inferred.
    when true then
        borrow first from samples
        borrow second from samples
        say first at 0
        say second at 0
        say samples at 0
    end when

    !!! One exclusive view. While it exists, no other read, write, move or
    !!! borrow of the owner is permitted. Mutability belongs to the view type,
    !!! so the view binding itself is not declared mutable.
    when true then
        borrow writable from samples exclusively
        set writable at 0 to 43
    end when

    !!! A move transfers the allocation into a new binding and invalidates the
    !!! source. A move does not free storage; the buffer is freed exactly once
    !!! when its current owner's scope exits, including through give,
    !!! stop repeating, continue repeating and fault unwinding.
    move samples into final_samples
    say final_samples at 0

    !!! Raw pointers are the unmanaged alternative: explicit allocation,
    !!! explicit release, no borrow checking.
    allocate raw as pointer to override byte sized 4
    set raw at 0 to 255 becomes override byte
    set raw at 1 to 256 becomes override byte     !!! wraps to 0
    say raw at 0
    say raw at 1
    release raw

    !!! Shared record handles. A reference aliases the object, not the
    !!! variable's storage: rebinding the original does not redirect it.
    variable sample is build Reading with level being 41
    value alias is reference to sample
    evaluate bump with sample being alias
    say sample.level                           !!! 42

    give 0
end paragraph
